      "header": "Deploy a production-grade reference architecture",
      "description": "Get multi-AZ Kubernetes (SKE), managed PostgreSQL, OpenSearch and S3-compatible object storage, plus observability and secrets management, with backup and restore configured and rehearsed before the first process goes live.",
