      "header": "Keep everything as code, in your Git",
      "description": "Run the entire platform as STACKIT Terraform, Helm and GitOps, reproducible per environment, reviewable in pull requests, and yours to keep, with no proprietary tooling and no lock-in.",
      "hideOnOverview": false,
      "position": 3,
      "characteristics": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6677388",
      "refId": "b65adac5-60b8-4242-afd6-0c815071fa1a",
